{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ee1f4f4b4e5ca6b60adc4288981419b0b5640512d0bd76503474fae53072edb", "ja": "「壊して壊して壊して……杏奈の理想の世界にする。\nあなたは邪魔だから。この剣で、消してあげる……！」", "zh": "「尽情破坏、破坏，再破坏……然后打造出杏奈理想中的\n世界。你太碍事了，就用这把剑来消灭你吧……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "a1649bf2387ddb53b81239f9b391563a961756090060e919142d094974a6669a", "ja": "どう……かな。{$P$}さん……。\nさっきの、演技……大丈夫……？", "zh": "怎么……样呢，{$P$}先生……\n刚才的演技……还可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4231f6cc44bbf31ccd63ba1f71e06f2342d3169d91b82680e5b95cd19079c1c1", "ja": "すごいじゃないか、杏奈。\n台本の読み合わせなのに、すごい迫力だったぞ！", "zh": "好厉害啊，杏奈。\n明明只是在对剧本台词，却很有魄力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "4b8bfe1efe9c3a16c3c6c5b1af2eb2c04db42b7c76b717166711299b098be027", "ja": "{$P$}さん……本当？\nよかった……。安心した……かも。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……真的吗？\n太好了……好像……有点放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "8507577db5220dcc03be37c06d4ec6c2113834c2eb7fc32abf84ce82555428b5", "ja": "杏奈……この役、もらえて……うれしかった、けど。\nちょっぴり、困った……悪役……。", "zh": "杏奈……虽然很高兴……能饰演这个角色，\n但也有点伤脑筋……因为是反派……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "40dc00d9f6404b937898226ad13789454ba42c9505d167da699d2f3f926ca687", "ja": "そうだな。\n悪役は、みんなを困らせる悪いやつだもんな……。", "zh": "是啊。\n毕竟反派是会让大家伤脑筋的坏人嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "eb698b3e010b5d115b251f4f461ad34f16bdc24acbbc1e0d6c401f011bc2019e", "ja": "ん……。でも、台本を、読んだら……\n魔王の気持ち……少し、わかった気がする……。", "zh": "嗯……不过，读了剧本后……\n总觉得多少……了解魔王的心情了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "644cb1260de606b827bc657ef37581a5ff47e52ac38d5d915770455fb511348c", "ja": "魔王は、ね……寂しかったの……ひとりが……。\n信じられる誰かが、そばにいなかったから……。", "zh": "魔王……总是孤单一人……很寂寞的……\n因为身边没有能信赖的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c539d07fd54ba93b8a4992aa5e5b1de746fc1e8a843a459c1027977ac3b354a3", "ja": "杏奈……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "7d92e9d6e6875dcdccd7b8b12d67c851e98288758e88acd39c98e111f66819fc", "ja": "杏奈は、いるよ……{$P$}さんや、\nみんな……大切な人、いっぱい……いる。だから……。", "zh": "杏奈的身边有喔……有{$P$}先生\n和大家……有很多重要的人在……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0023_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "514db9dae9c2aee8be63378b5ad435c8cd3c09a66427b645592dcb6765763852", "ja": "最後の撮影も、頑張れ……ます。杏奈のこと……、\nしっかり見てて……{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "最后的拍摄，杏奈也会加油……请你好好……\n看着杏奈喔……{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
